{"id":"tobruk","name":"Tobruk","qid":"Q182092","country":"Libya","locality":"Butnan District","lat":"32.083333333","lon":"23.95","built":"","year":null,"year_text":"","century":"","era":"Date not recorded","period":"","date_basis":"","style":"","heritage":"","type":"city; port city; big city; municipality of Libya","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tobruk","text":"Tobruk ( tə-BRUUK, toh-BRUUK; Arabic: طبرق, romanized: Ṭubruq; Italian: Tobruch) is a port city on Libya's eastern Mediterranean coast, near the border with Egypt. It is the capital of the Butnan District (formerly Tobruk District) and has a population of 120,000 (2011 est.). Tobruk was the site of an ancient Greek colony and, later, of a Roman fortress guarding the frontier of Cyrenaica.","text_source":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Tobruk","text_license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","real":[],"depictions":[{"id":"battlefield-1942--tobruk","game":"battlefield-1942","name":"Tobruk","verified":false,"text":"The Siege of Tobruk (Arabic: حصار طبرق) was a series of North African-theatre battles of World War II, fought in 1941-2 between Nazi German attackers and Australian defenders, over the town's invaluable harbor. In the initial battle, the Australians held off the Nazi attack. The next year, the city was captured by the Germans in a second battle.","text_source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/Tobruk","text_license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","images":[{"id":"gh-11b8375c5a00","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1942, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:BF1942.Tobruk_1st_Line_Left_3.png","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by Slopijoe on 2025-10-10"}},{"id":"gh-5a6bddf6cd4c","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1942, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:BF1942.Tobruk_1st_Line_Center_1.png","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by Slopijoe on 2025-10-10"}},{"id":"gh-68d163bc7508","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1942, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:BF1942.Tobruk_1st_Line_Left_1.png","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by Slopijoe on 2025-10-10"}},{"id":"gh-797e1a8cc638","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1942, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:BF1942.Tobruk_1st_Line_Center_3.png","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by Slopijoe on 2025-10-10"}},{"id":"gh-a05c08eac48f","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1942, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:BF1942.Tobruk_1st_Line_Center_2.png","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by Slopijoe on 2025-10-10"}},{"id":"gh-c5d2a4cd4503","w":1400,"h":788,"credit":{"text":"Screenshot from Battlefield 1942, © Electronic Arts.","source":"https://battlefield.fandom.com/wiki/File:BF1942.Tobruk_1st_Line_Left_2.png","via":"Fandom (battlefield)","note":"Fandom upload by Slopijoe on 2025-10-10"}}]}]}